      "writtenOn": "2020-10-29T16:23:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of adding periphal specific hanlding to this function, perhaps it would be better to create a `i2cxfer raw` command instead where you could manually specify all of the read and writes. This would be similar to the `ectool i2cxfer` command.\n\nWe really don\u0027t want perihphal specific quirks in comment code like this. It will get extremely difficult to maintain.",
      "revId": "0a899f1a81de08a2b5e42e04e014ee19cc06d89e",
